{"ID":"20240205153920-er4y3zy","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153920-er4y3zy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153920-er4y3zy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082211-4leg63r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607100730-pbpwsgk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618133654-5jrg398\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"031茈胡（柴胡）","type":"doc","updated":"20240802125212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240802105946-m18gyx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802105946-m18gyx2","updated":"20240802105946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618132145-sd2xv64.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240206082211-4leg63r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082211-4leg63r","updated":"20240802110519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北柴胡"}]},{"ID":"20240206082223-283dy4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082223-283dy4g","updated":"20240206082227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t呈圆柱形或长圆锥形，长615cm，直径0.30.8cm。根头膨大，顶端残留3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15个茎基或短纤维状叶基，下部分枝。表面黑褐色或浅棕色，具纵皱纹、支根痕及皮孔。质硬而韧，不易折断，断面显片状纤维性，皮部浅棕色，木部黄白色。气微香，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t和解少阳，疏肝解郁。透表泄热，升举阳气。用于感冒发热、寒热往来、疟疾，肝郁气滞，胸肋胀痛，脱肛，子宫脱落，月经不调。"}]},{"ID":"20240206082214-q1b26yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082214-q1b26yy","updated":"20240802110528"},"Children":